{
  "name": "Start",
  "comment": "A run saved inside Sub, kept in a .plang file (signed by this app) and read back, goes on from its save: the save\nanswers again, Sub's next step reads the context's %name% and its frame's %city%, and Record goes on after the call.\nThe step before the save doesn't run again (%count% comes back 1). What the first run set after the save is cleared\nfirst, so only the resumed run can set it again.",
